--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:02,540] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 女人想搞錢必須先先死
Segment #2   [00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:04,460] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 尤其是那些原生家庭不好的
Segment #3   [00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,780] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 出生等底層的女人
Segment #4   [00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,100] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 13 | Text: 你想要搞錢你就做到這三個字就行了
Segment #5   [00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,220] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是反人性
Segment #6   [00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,280] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 反對一切人意理智性
Segment #7   [00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,120] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 拋開那種傳統道德的枷鎖
Segment #8   [00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:13,980] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 怎麼做呢
Segment #9   [00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:14,820] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 就三個點
Segment #10  [00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:15,780] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 我接下來說的話
Segment #11  [00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,220] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 你沒一定要點爛收藏
Segment #12  [00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,300] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 反覆認真地去看
Segment #13  [00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,460] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 因為那個視頻隨時會
Segment #14  [00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,120] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 就被下架了就沒了
Segment #15  [00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,040] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 這些全部是父母不懂
Segment #16  [00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,840] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 學校裡不交的人性禁忌
Segment #17  [00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:26,320] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 1  | Text: 第一
Segment #18  [00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:27,940] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是利益之上
Segment #19  [00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:28,560] | Elapsed:  14.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 任何的事
Segment #20  [00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,200] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 9  | Text: 你付出了勞動結果的事
Segment #21  [00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:30,760] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告訴你們
Segment #22  [00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,460] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 必須要去談
Segment #23  [00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,400] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 你能得到的回報
Segment #24  [00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,140] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 你不要不好意思
Segment #25  [00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,440] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 交易就是交易
Segment #26  [00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,160] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要有付出
Segment #27  [00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,360] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 就必須要有回報
Segment #28  [00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,600] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不接受道德綁架
Segment #29  [00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,180] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 就認識一個人過來跟你聊
Segment #30  [00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,320] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 說你貪錢上感情了
Segment #31  [00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,380] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 你直接讓他滾蛋就行了
Segment #32  [00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,940] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 沒有回報的付出
Segment #33  [00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,220] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 9  | Text: 只會讓別人覺得你廉價
Segment #34  [00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,400] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 9  | Text: 你看看你一分錢都不值
Segment #35  [00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,620] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 9  | Text: 不要覺得見賣你的時間和能力
Segment #36  [00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,680] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 只有弱者才會相信感情
Segment #37  [00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,860] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 2  | Text: 第二就是
Segment #38  [00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,480] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 一定要殺死那個討好行人
Segment #39  [00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:54,960] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 2  | Text: 覺得自己
Segment #40  [00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,520] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 女人一直在被要求
Segment #41  [00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,660] | Elapsed:  31.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 我要做一個好媽媽
Segment #42  [00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:59,060] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 我要做一個好妻子
Segment #43  [00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:00,600] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是從來沒有任何一個人
Segment #44  [00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,180] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 3  | Text: 告訴過你
Segment #45  [00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:02,140] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 3  | Text: 你要做自己
Segment #46  [00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,960] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 9  | Text: 你不要害怕被別人討厭
Segment #47  [00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:06,220] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 10 | Text: 有人罵你說明你過得比他好
Segment #48  [00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:07,280] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 我們寧願做一個
Segment #49  [00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,360] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 4  | Text: 在深夜裡
Segment #50  [00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,420] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 9  | Text: 背負了所有罵名的壞人
Segment #51  [00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:11,520] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 我們也不要去做一個
Segment #52  [00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,640] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 暴徒痛苦的好人
Segment #53  [00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,160] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 1  | Text: 當然
Segment #54  [00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,800] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 你可以做一個好女人
Segment #55  [00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:15,540] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是一定不能
Segment #56  [00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:16,700] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 4  | Text: 為了家庭
Segment #57  [00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,060] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 拋棄了自己的事業
Segment #58  [00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,540] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 9  | Text: 拋棄了原本的你那個自己
Segment #59  [00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:21,100] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 去放棄自己的未來
Segment #60  [00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:21,940] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 我告訴你這不行的
Segment #61  [00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:23,440] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 人是有自己強大了
Segment #62  [00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,560] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 10 | Text: 你才能得到別人的尊重
Segment #63  [00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,920] | Elapsed:  49.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 選擇權在自己的手裡
Segment #64  [00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,200] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 永遠比靠別人
Segment #65  [00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,160] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 等著別人要有用
Segment #66  [00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,860] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 第三就是沉默沉默
Segment #67  [00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,800] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 不參與中大決策
Segment #68  [00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,720] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 底層的女人
Segment #69  [00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:32,860] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 她最容易被困住的
Segment #70  [00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:33,880] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是在一件事情上
Segment #71  [00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:35,060] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 我感覺我投入了
Segment #72  [00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,080] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 過多的時間經歷
Segment #73  [00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:36,600] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 2  | Text: 最後呢
Segment #74  [00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,600] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 爛爛爛是
Segment #75  [00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,260] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 不要把我給活活的拖死
Segment #76  [00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:40,960] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 其實如果你在猶豫
Segment #77  [00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,560] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 我要不要和另外一個人分開
Segment #78  [00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,640] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 無論是親情還是友情
Segment #79  [00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,800] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 你都不要用回憶
Segment #80  [00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:46,900] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 去做個平凡的標準
Segment #81  [00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:47,820] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 而且你去想
Segment #82  [00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:48,880] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是今天的我
Segment #83  [00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,260] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 遇到了今天的她
Segment #84  [00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:52,280] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 我還會不會和這個人在一起
Segment #85  [00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,640] | Elapsed:  66.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 我還會不會和她去交心
Segment #86  [00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,120] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 8  | Text: 這才是真正的標準
Segment #87  [00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,160] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 若若不行啊
Segment #88  [00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:57,700] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告訴你們
Segment #89  [00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,180] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 停止就是最好的選手
Segment #90  [00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:00,380] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 什麼叫做沉默沉默
Segment #91  [00:02:00,380 --> 00:02:02,180] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是已經沉默在水裡的沉默
Segment #92  [00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,380] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 已經不是沉默了
Segment #93  [00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:05,160] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 一個女人最大的福報
Segment #94  [00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,060] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 是覺醒
Segment #95  [00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:07,260] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 女人想高興
Segment #96  [00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:08,960] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 是必須新鮮死
Segment #97  [00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,120] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 5  | Text: 家人們是誰
Segment #98  [00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,980] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你們越來越好
Segment #99  [00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:13,860] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 7  | Text: 女人若若不覺醒
Segment #100 [00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:14,620] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告訴你們
Segment #101 [00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:15,200] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 3  | Text: 慢著玩
Segment #102 [00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:16,100] | Elapsed:  80.55s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
